# the desktop's "Print" of a text file: tools/dev/st/documents/desktop/PRINT.TXT on
# a launcher whose desktop opens drive A's window at boot
# (make_launcher.py --files tools/dev/st/documents/desktop --window 'A:\*.*'); the file
# is selected with a click, opened from the File menu, and TOS's alert's Print
# is clicked. Positions are TOS 1.x's low-resolution desktop.
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/launchers/desktop.st
wait 100
key 0x01
desktop 2500
wait 50
mouse 280 180
click left 2
wait 25
mouse 180 51
click left 2
wait 25
mouse 88 5
mouse 88 14
click left 2
wait 100
printwatch
mouse 160 127
click left 2
printer 100 3000
